  "raw": {
    "https://careers.uky.edu/": {
      "title": "University.",
      "description": "UK Employment Gateway Skip to content UK Careers Gateway University. More Than A University. Explore open positions across the entire UK enterprise. Whether you are looking for roles within the University of Kentucky, UK HealthCare, UK Athletics, UK St. Claire or UK Kingâs Daughters, this portal connects you to rewarding careers dedicated to serving our communities. What kind of position are you looking for? Nursing and clinical care Deliver high-quality patient care and support clinical outcomes across health systems, academic medical center and regional hospitals. Learn More → Information technology Power enterprise operations through reliable tech support, systems architecture and modern digital solutions. Learn More → Revenue cycle Streamline patient billing, insurance processing and health system financial operations. Learn More → Human Resources Champion workforce recruitment and employee growth across organizational teams. Learn More → Finance Guide financial planning, accounting and resource allocation across the entire organization. Learn More → Supply Chain Coordinate global procurement and local logistics to keep daily operations fully equipped. Learn More → Administrative and professional Keep key departments running smoothly through dedicated operational leadership and program support. Learn More → Research and academic Advance pioneering discovery and support academic excellence across diverse fields of study. Learn More → Marketing Build brand engagement and tell compelling stories across all communication channels. Learn More → Facilities, trades and services Maintain safe, welcoming environments through skilled trades, food services, custodial care and patient support. Learn More → Legal Protect institutional interests through proactive legal strategy, compliance and risk management. Learn More → Athletics Support sports operations, event management and fan experience for Wildcat athletic programs. Learn More → Police and security Promote a safe and secure environment for students, faculty, staff, patients and visitors. Learn More → Or browse by location Lexington, KY Ashland, KY Morehead, KY Remote/other locations Our organizational structure and benefits The University of Kentucky is strengthening how we meet the needs of communities across the commonwealth. This collaborative ecosystem creates multiple paths to join us as you grow your career and help us fulfill our mission. You can explore career opportunities at each of our entities. Benefits vary by position and employer within the UK enterprise. While the UK Employment Gateway helps you discover opportunities across our entire network, each role is maintained by its specific employing organization. Benefits vary by position and employer within the UK enterprise. Learn how benefits work across UK. University of Kentucky An Equal Opportunity University Â© 2026 University of Kentucky"
    },
    "https://ukjobs.uky.edu": {
      "title": "University of Kentucky Applicant Site",
      "description": "University of Kentucky Applicant Site | Home Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Sign Up For Job Alerts! Log In /Create Account Help Applicant Support Welcome to UK Jobs! At the University of Kentucky, we are dedicated to improving people’s lives through excellence in education, research and creative work, service, and health care. As Kentucky’s flagship institution, we play a critical leadership role by promoting diversity, inclusion, economic development and human well-being. We are looking for more people to join us in this mission. More than a university Explore more positions across the entire UK enterprise and affiliated entities, including patient care, IT, revenue cycle, athletics and more. Learn more about rewarding careers dedicated to serving our communities. Learn more > Click below to search for job opportunities by position type. Campus Staff Positions Healthcare Staff Positions Faculty|Physician Positions Temporary Positions Student Positions All Positions Nursing Opportunities Tips for Applying Working At UK Benefits We’re an Equal Opportunity Employer The University follows both the federal and state Constitutions as well as all applicable federal and state laws on nondiscrimination. The University provides equal opportunities for qualified persons in all aspects of institutional operations and does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national origin, ethnic origin, religion, creed, age, physical or mental disability, veteran status, uniformed service, political belief, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, marital status, genetic information or social or economic status. UK Strategic Plan As Kentucky’s indispensable institution, we transform the lives of our students and advance the Commonwealth we serve. Learn more Clery Act The Annual Safety and Security Report includes the latest statistics for the previous three years concerning reported crimes that occurred on campus; in certain off-campus buildings owned or controlled by UK; and on public property immediately adjacent to campus. The report also includes institutional policies concerning campus security. You can access the report at http://go.uky.edu/safetyreport . Paper copies will be provided upon request. The Annual Fire Safety Report includes statistics for the three previous calendar years concerning reported fires in on-campus student housing facilities, such as residence halls, Greek housing, graduate housing, or at any facility designated as a place of residence for students. The report also includes a description of fire safety systems; yearly fire drills; policies on portable electrical appliances, furniture, decorations, bicycles/motorized scooters, and open flames; evacuation procedures; policies on fire safety education and training; and contact information. You can access the report at http://go.uky.edu/firereport . Paper copies will be provided upon request. 805 Las Cimas Parkway Suite 400 Austin, Texas, 78746 © University of Kentucky Lexington, Kentucky 40506 An Equal Opportunity University Accreditation Directory Email Privacy Policy Copyright © Faber To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
    },
